h My Galaxy! is an immersive puzzle game where you use a cosmic slingshot to fire asteroids at alien invaders that are attacking defenceless planets.                                                                                                                                                                         \n\n{2501985030252967}\n\nUsing hand tracking or controllers, combine the gravitational pull of the planets with the special powers of your asteroids to perform incredible trick shots.\n\n{1467700694699209}\n\nYour goal is to destroy the alien invaders as efficiently as possible. Set great scores to earn more stars, unlocking over 100 levels of planetary puzzles to solve.\n\n{1430533594856670}\n\nPlay in a choice of mixed reality or VR on Quest 3 and 3S, or in fantastic immersive VR on Quest 2, to experience Oh My Galaxy! brought to life in your home or headset.\n\n{2159426988193949}", "short_description": "Bring the cosmos to your home \n\n- Built from the ground up for mixed reality on Meta Quest \n- Intuitive gesture tracking puts real slingshot power at your fingertips. \n- Bring an arcade slingshot space attack into your living room "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ndreams.com/oh-my-galaxy-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ndreams.com/oh-my-galaxy-end-user-licensing-agreement", "publisher_name": "Megabit Publishing", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ndreams.com/games/oh-my-galaxy", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "reco